             _/_v_a_r_/_d_b_/_e_n_t_r_o_p_y.  If set to "NO" it disables caching entropy via
             cron(8).  This setting is shared with _/_e_t_c_/_r_c_._d_/_r_a_n_d_o_m.

     _e_n_t_r_o_p_y___s_a_v_e___s_z
